### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "facu@test2.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login (grab token)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "facu@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Create application (use token from login)
POST http://localhost:3000/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI1ZDE2MDM0Mi01NGMyLTQzZGUtYTc0NS04YzI2Y2ZjNWJhNzEiLCJlbWFpbCI6ImZhY3VAdGVzdC5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3OTEzNzUxOTMsImV4cCI6MTc5MTk3OTk5M30.brw8kZIFXVeYi0rlLzioqkE-6fzqmqQq2urn-T1fSEY

{
  "company": "Praemium",
  "role": "Senior Software Engineer",
  "salaryMin": 170000,
  "salaryMax": 190000,
  "status": "APPLIED",
